hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2676","###\n Narrated to us Muhammad bin Bashshar, who said: Narrated to us Abd al-Wahhab al-Thaqafi, who said: Narrated to us Khalid al-Hadda', from Abu Qilabah, from Abd al-Rahman bin Abi Layla, from Ka'b bin Ujrah (RA), who said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) came to me at the time of Al-Hudaybiyyah while I had a lot of hair. He said, \"It seems that the parasites of your head"
